<title>UK: LASMO almost doubles 1996 profits.</title>
<headline>LASMO almost doubles 1996 profits.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996 (million sterling unless stated)</p>
<p>EPS (pence)	 5.3	vs     1.6</p>
<p>Dividend (pence)  2.0	vs     1.25</p>
<p>Turnover	     749     vs    637</p>
<p>Operating profit   208     vs    112</p>
<p>Year profit	   67     vs     34</p>
<p>Net cash flow	277     vs     229</p>
<p>Tax		    139     vs     110</p>
<p>Net debt	     346     vs     489</p>
</text>
